Package: MosaBiomeUtils
Title: Standardized Project Structure and Workflow for MosaBiome Statistical Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("MosaBiome", email = "info@mosabiome.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities to standardize project structure and workflow for
    statistical analysis within MosaBiome. Includes project template creation,
    Quarto/RMarkdown report templates, RStudio/Positron addins for code formatting,
    and author name management across sessions.
